  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Id'fix is a dog grooming salon in Trans-en-Provence, a town near Draguignan in the Var. It has no website of its own: public information comes from directories, which agree on the name and the town but not on the exact address.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon's Google Maps listing, updated in early November 2026 and credited with recent reviews (up to August 2026), gives 29 avenue de la Gare, 83720 Trans-en-Provence, with phone 04 94 84 58 22 and opening Monday to Friday 8:30 am to 6:30 pm, closed at weekends. Another directory (Opendi) places an "Idefix" at the Arcadia shopping centre, route de Draguignan, with a different number (04 94 84 57 89); a local directory (Alentoor) also lists "Id Fix" on route de Draguignan, Arcadia shopping centre.</p>
      <p>These sources do not settle it: the salon may have changed address, or one listing may be out of date. Only a call to 04 94 84 58 22 can confirm the current address, hours, prices and the animals accepted, none of which the salon publishes itself.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: before travelling with your dog, call to confirm the address (avenue de la Gare or Arcadia shopping centre), as directories disagree.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Trans-en-Provence is a village near Draguignan, in the inland Var. For a walk with your dog before or after grooming, check the rules of each place on site.</p>
